OL,3,AStorm Austen brings 84mph wind gusts as
OL,4,Athousands of UK homes without power
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday, a separate storm, named
OL,7,FBoelo, is forecast to bring more strong
OL,8,Fwinds to Scotland and Northern Ireland
OL,9,Fas well as North West and North East
OL,10,FEngland
OL,12,FAn amber wind warning will kick in from
OL,13,F21:00 tomorrow until Sunday evening
OL,14,Facross much of Scotland, parts of
OL,15,FNorthern Ireland as well as northern
OL,16,FEngland
